      "type": "text",
      "title": "Example Use Case",
      "content": {
        "markdown": "Larkspur applies `stale-while-revalidate` to article pages, where a minute of staleness is acceptable. It is not used for time-sensitive content like live election results."
      },
      "cites": ["P1.4"]
    },
    {
      "id": "n4",
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Stale-while-revalidate Bound",
      "content": {
